{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S01这类停留时间短、感受词又集中出现的段落里显得偏密，X更容易一眼扫完。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用【】突出心理变化的关键落点，普通观众不必读完所有感受词，也能抓住人物每一阶段在想什么、为什么犹豫或放松。尤其是音乐走到相应小节才出现的感受词，让声音变化、身体感受和人物心理形成了更细密的对应，前后反复出现的亲近、害怕失去、逐渐不再隐藏也构成了连续的故事。X的优势是画面相对清爽、扫读省力，但部分感受表达比较概括，音乐中的细微起伏和人物心理转折没有Y呈现得充分。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "000556f7-fdf5-43f6-b5a3-0ddfbbffbd41", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T011535551368Z", "elapsed_seconds": 99.344, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:17:14.903523+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "99a5c0839a7f20e4ad16e8073003d6c79c07fe1d01b489e14478f9934a9c15bf", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attac